      "generated_answer": "<think>\nDP: healthy, upset states.\n</think>\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    n = int(input_data[0])\n    NEG = float('-inf')\n    h = 0  # healthy\n    u = NEG  # upset\n    idx = 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        x = int(input_data[idx]); y = int(input_data[idx+1]); idx += 2\n        if x == 0:\n            new_h = max(h, h + y, u + y)\n            new_u = u\n        else:\n            new_h = h\n            new_u = max(u, h + y)\n        h, u = new_h, new_u\n    print(max(h, u, 0))\n\nmain()\n```",
