      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef circularGameLosers(n, k):\n    seen = set()\n    cur = 0\n    i = 1\n    while cur not in seen:\n        seen.add(cur)\n        cur = (cur + i * k) % n\n        i += 1\n    return [x + 1 for x in range(n) if x not in seen]\n```",
