presentation modulo 998244353 is 776412280.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n1\r\n998244352\n\nSample Output 2\n\n998244352\n\nSample Input 3\n\n9\r\n3 14 159 2653 58979 323846 2643383 27950288 419716939\n\nSample Output 3\n\n545252774",
