      "generated_answer": "<think>\nStandard problem. Compute C = number of green components. For each red cell, new components = C + 1 - (number of distinct green components adjacent to it). Sum over red cells, divide by R (number of red cells).\n\nUse DSU on green cells.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom sys import setrecursionlimit\n\ndef main():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    H = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    W = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    grid = []\n    for i in range(H):\n        grid.append(input_data[idx].decode()); idx+=1\n    \n    MOD = 998244353\n    \n    parent = list(range(H*W))\n    rank_ = [0]*(H*W)\n    \n    def find(x):\n        while parent[x] != x:\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\n            x = parent[x]\n        return x\n    \n    def union(a,b):\n        a = find(a); b = find(b)\n        if a == b: return\n        if rank_[a] < rank_[b]:\n            a,b = b,a\n        parent[b] = a\n        if rank_[a] == rank_[b]:\n            rank_[a] += 1\n    \n    def idx_fn(i,j):\n        return i*W+j\n    \n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == '#':\n                if i+1 < H and grid[i+1][j] == '#':\n                    union(idx_fn(i,j), idx_fn(i+1,j))\n                if j+1 < W and grid[i][j+1] == '#':\n                    union(idx_fn(i,j), idx_fn(i,j+1))\n    \n    # Count components\n    roots = set()\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == '#':\n                roots.add(find(idx_fn(i,j)))\n    C = len(roots)\n    \n    R = 0\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == '.':\n                R += 1\n                neighbors = set()\n                for di,dj in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\n                    ni,nj = i+di, j+dj\n                    if 0 <= ni < H and 0 <= nj < W and grid[ni][nj] == '#':\n                        neighbors.add(find(idx_fn(ni,nj)))\n                new_comp = C + 1 - len(neighbors)\n                total += new_comp\n    \n    ans = total % MOD * pow(R, MOD-2, MOD) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nmain()\n```",
