      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumTimeToInitialState(word, k):\n    n = len(word)\n    t = 1\n    while t * k < n:\n        if word[t*k:] == word[:n - t*k]:\n            return t\n        t += 1\n    return t\n```",
