    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minExtraChar(s, dictionary):\n    n = len(s)\n    words = set(dictionary)\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 1\n        for j in range(i):\n            if s[j:i] in words:\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j])\n    return dp[n]\n```",
