      "generated_answer": "<think>\nBFS from each medicine location. Build graph: nodes are medicine positions (plus start). From each medicine i with energy E_i, do BFS up to E_i steps, and if it can reach another medicine j or T, add edge.\n\nStart: treat S as a node. From S with 0 energy... actually S must have a medicine on it or we can't move. So check if there's a medicine at S.\n\nLet me just include S as node 0 with energy 0, then do BFS from each node with its energy.\n\nActually simpler: from each medicine, BFS reachable cells within E_i steps. If T is reachable from some medicine, and that medicine is reachable... \n\nBuild graph over medicines + S. Edge from medicine i to medicine j if BFS distance ≤ E_i. Then from S, we need a medicine at S to start (or S is T). Then check reachability to any medicine that can reach T.\n\nLet me include S as a special node with 0 energy. Then S can reach medicine j only if S==position of j (distance 0). Also check if S==T.\n\nLet me code it.\n</think>\n\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    H = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    W = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    grid = []\n    for i in range(H):\n        grid.append(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    S = T = None\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == 'S':\n                S = (i, j)\n            elif grid[i][j] == 'T':\n                T = (i, j)\n    \n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    meds = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        r = int(input_data[idx]) - 1; idx += 1\n        c = int(input_data[idx]) - 1; idx += 1\n        e = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n        meds.append((r, c, e))\n    \n    if S == T:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n        return\n    \n    def bfs(sr, sc, limit):\n        dist = [[-1]*W for _ in range(H)]\n        dist[sr][sc] = 0\n        q = deque([(sr, sc)])\n        while q:\n            r, c = q.popleft()\n            if dist[r][c] >= limit:\n                continue\n            for dr, dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\n                nr, nc = r+dr, c+dc\n                if 0 <= nr < H and 0 <= nc < W and grid[nr][nc] != '#' and dist[nr][nc] == -1:\n                    dist[nr][nc] = dist[r][c] + 1\n                    q.append((nr, nc))\n        return dist\n    \n    # Find medicine at S\n    start_med = -1\n    for i, (r, c, e) in enumerate(meds):\n        if (r, c) == S:\n            start_med = i\n            break\n    \n    if start_med == -1:\n        print(\"No\")\n        return\n    \n    # BFS from each medicine, check reach to T or other medicines\n    visited = [False] * N\n    visited[start_med] = True\n    queue = deque([start_med])\n    while queue:\n        i = queue.popleft()\n        r, c, e = meds[i]\n        dist = bfs(r, c, e)\n        if dist[T[0]][T[1]] != -1:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n            return\n        for j in range(N):\n            if not visited[j]:\n                rj, cj, _ = meds[j]\n                if dist[rj][cj] != -1:\n                    visited[j] = True\n                    queue.append(j)\n    \n    print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
