      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumOperationsToMakeKPeriodic(word, k):\n    from collections import Counter\n    n = len(word)\n    chunks = [word[i:i+k] for i in range(0, n, k)]\n    c = Counter(chunks)\n    return len(chunks) - max(c.values())\n```",
