      "generated_answer": "<think>\nMulti-source BFS with priority: use Dijkstra-like where we want to know if any guard reaches. Initialize with each guard having remaining stamina h_i, do BFS taking max remaining stamina.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom heapq import heappush, heappop\n\ndef main():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    M = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    K = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    adj = [[] for _ in range(N+1)]\n    for _ in range(M):\n        a = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        b = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        adj[a].append(b)\n        adj[b].append(a)\n    \n    best = [-1]*(N+1)  # max remaining stamina\n    heap = []\n    for _ in range(K):\n        p = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        h = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        if h > best[p]:\n            best[p] = h\n            heappush(heap, (-h, p))\n    \n    while heap:\n        neg_h, u = heappop(heap)\n        h = -neg_h\n        if h < best[u]:\n            continue\n        if h == 0:\n            continue\n        for v in adj[u]:\n            nh = h - 1\n            if nh > best[v]:\n                best[v] = nh\n                heappush(heap, (-nh, v))\n    \n    result = [i for i in range(1, N+1) if best[i] >= 0]\n    print(len(result))\n    print(*result)\n\nmain()\n```",
