      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef continuousSubarrays(nums):\n    from collections import deque\n    max_dq = deque()\n    min_dq = deque()\n    left = 0\n    ans = 0\n    for right, x in enumerate(nums):\n        while max_dq and nums[max_dq[-1]] <= x:\n            max_dq.pop()\n        max_dq.append(right)\n        while min_dq and nums[min_dq[-1]] >= x:\n            min_dq.pop()\n        min_dq.append(right)\n        while nums[max_dq[0]] - nums[min_dq[0]] > 2:\n            left += 1\n            if max_dq[0] < left:\n                max_dq.popleft()\n            if min_dq[0] < left:\n                min_dq.popleft()\n        ans += right - left + 1\n    return ans\n```",
