      "generated_answer": "<think>\nFor each S_i, check if it could be T given T'. Conditions:\n- S == T'\n- |len(S) - len(T')| == 1 and one is obtained by deletion from the other\n- |len(S)| == |T'| and hamming distance <= 1\n\nLet me code this efficiently.\n\nFor len equal: count mismatches, allow <=1.\nFor len diff 1: longer vs shorter, check if shorter can be obtained by deleting one char from longer. Find first mismatch from left and first from right, check if they overlap.\n\nLet T' = U. For each S:\n- if S == U: yes\n- if len(S) == len(U): count diffs, yes if <=1\n- if len(S) == len(U)+1: S has one extra char. Check if deleting one char from S gives U.\n- if len(S)+1 == len(U): U has one extra char. Check if deleting one char from U gives S.\n- else: no\n\nFor the deletion check: given longer L and shorter M (len L = len M + 1), find i = first index where L[i]!=M[i]. Then check if L[i+1:] == M[i:].\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    U = input_data[idx].decode(); idx += 1\n    lu = len(U)\n    result = []\n    for i in range(1, N+1):\n        S = input_data[idx].decode(); idx += 1\n        ls = len(S)\n        ok = False\n        if S == U:\n            ok = True\n        elif ls == lu:\n            diff = 0\n            for a, b in zip(S, U):\n                if a != b:\n                    diff += 1\n                    if diff > 1:\n                        break\n            if diff <= 1:\n                ok = True\n        elif ls == lu + 1:\n            # delete one from S to get U\n            j = 0\n            while j < lu and S[j] == U[j]:\n                j += 1\n            # S[j+1:] should equal U[j:]\n            if S[j+1:] == U[j:]:\n                ok = True\n        elif ls + 1 == lu:\n            j = 0\n            while j < ls and S[j] == U[j]:\n                j += 1\n            if U[j+1:] == S[j:]:\n                ok = True\n        if ok:\n            result.append(i)\n    print(len(result))\n    print(*result)\n\nsolve()\n```",
