      "generated_answer": "<think>\nCheck for each top-left (i,j) with i+8<=N, j+8<=M.\n\nTop-left 3x3 (rows i..i+2, cols j..j+2) all '#'.\nBottom-right 3x3 (rows i+6..i+8, cols j+6..j+8) all '#'.\n\nAdjacent cells to top-left 3x3: those adjacent horizontally, vertically, diagonally. The cells adjacent form the border around 3x3. Within the 9x9, adjacent cells: row i+3 cols j..j+3, and rows i..i+3 col j+3. That's 4+4=8... wait, cells adjacent to top-left 3x3 within the 9x9: the cells (i, j+3), (i+1, j+3), (i+2, j+3), (i+3, j), (i+3, j+1), (i+3, j+2), (i+3, j+3). That's 7. Similarly for bottom-right: (i+5, j+5..j+8) and (i+6..i+8, j+5). 7. Total 14. Good.\n\nAll these must be '.'.\n</think>\n\n```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    M = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    S = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        S.append(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    results = []\n    for i in range(N - 8):\n        for j in range(M - 8):\n            ok = True\n            # top-left 3x3 all #\n            for r in range(3):\n                for c in range(3):\n                    if S[i+r][j+c] != '#':\n                        ok = False\n                        break\n                if not ok: break\n            if not ok: continue\n            # bottom-right 3x3 all #\n            for r in range(6, 9):\n                for c in range(6, 9):\n                    if S[i+r][j+c] != '#':\n                        ok = False\n                        break\n                if not ok: break\n            if not ok: continue\n            # adjacent to top-left: row i+3, cols j..j+3; col j+3, rows i..i+2\n            adj_tl = [(i+3, j+c) for c in range(4)] + [(i+r, j+3) for r in range(3)]\n            for r, c in adj_tl:\n                if S[r][c] != '.':\n                    ok = False\n                    break\n            if not ok: continue\n            # adjacent to bottom-right: row i+5, cols j+5..j+8; col j+5, rows i+6..i+8\n            adj_br = [(i+5, j+5+c) for c in range(4)] + [(i+6+r, j+5) for r in range(3)]\n            for r, c in adj_br:\n                if S[r][c] != '.':\n                    ok = False\n                    break\n            if not ok: continue\n            results.append((i+1, j+1))\n    \n    for r, c in results:\n        print(r, c)\n\nsolve()\n```",
