      "generated_answer": "<think>\nStandard DP: dp[i][j] = largest holeless square with bottom-right at (i,j). Sum all dp values.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    H = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    W = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n    holed = [[False]*(W+2) for _ in range(H+2)]\n    for _ in range(N):\n        a = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        b = int(input_data[idx]); idx+=1\n        holed[a][b] = True\n    \n    dp = [[0]*(W+2) for _ in range(H+2)]\n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(1, H+1):\n        row = dp[i]\n        prev = dp[i-1]\n        hrow = holed[i]\n        for j in range(1, W+1):\n            if hrow[j]:\n                row[j] = 0\n            else:\n                v = prev[j-1]\n                a = prev[j]\n                b = row[j-1]\n                if a < v: v = a\n                if b < v: v = b\n                row[j] = v + 1\n                ans += v + 1\n    print(ans)\n\nmain()\n```",
