re is the graph corresponding to this input, where 1 \\leftrightarrow 2 represents the existence of both 1 \\rightarrow 2 and 2 \\rightarrow 1:\n\nSample Input 3\n\n8\r\n3 7 4 7 3 3 8 2\n\nSample Output 3\n\n3\r\n2 7 8\r\n\nHere is the graph corresponding to this input:",
