      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestSemiRepetitiveSubstring(s):\n    n = len(s)\n    left = 0\n    pairs = 0\n    ans = 1\n    for right in range(1, n):\n        if s[right] == s[right-1]:\n            pairs += 1\n        while pairs > 1:\n            left += 1\n            if s[left] == s[left-1]:\n                pairs -= 1\n        ans = max(ans, right - left + 1)\n    return ans\n```",
