      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumDeletions(word, k):\n    from collections import Counter\n    freqs = sorted(Counter(word).values())\n    total = sum(freqs)\n    best = total\n    for i, f in enumerate(freqs):\n        # keep min freq = f, max allowed = f + k\n        deletions = sum(freqs[:i])  # delete all smaller\n        for j in range(i, len(freqs)):\n            if freqs[j] > f + k:\n                deletions += freqs[j] - (f + k)\n        best = min(best, deletions)\n    return best\n```",
