      "generated_answer": "<think>\nLCM of 1..8 = 840. Precompute for each residue mod 840 at bus stop 1, the arrival time at bus stop N. Then for query q, arrive at stop 1 at q+X, compute residue, add precomputed offset, add Y.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom math import lcm\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx]); idx+=1\n    X = int(data[idx]); idx+=1\n    Y = int(data[idx]); idx+=1\n    P = []\n    T = []\n    for i in range(N-1):\n        P.append(int(data[idx])); idx+=1\n        T.append(int(data[idx])); idx+=1\n    L = 840\n    # For each starting residue r at stop 1, compute total time to reach stop N\n    offset = [0]*L\n    for r in range(L):\n        t = r\n        for i in range(N-1):\n            p = P[i]\n            # wait until next multiple of p\n            rem = t % p\n            if rem != 0:\n                t += p - rem\n            t += T[i]\n        offset[r] = t - r\n    Q = int(data[idx]); idx+=1\n    out = []\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        q = int(data[idx]); idx+=1\n        arr1 = q + X\n        r = arr1 % L\n        ans = arr1 + offset[r] + Y\n        out.append(str(ans))\n    sys.stdout.write('\\n'.join(out))\n\nmain()\n```",
