      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef semiOrderedPermutation(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    i = nums.index(1)\n    j = nums.index(n)\n    if i < j:\n        return i + (n - 1 - j)\n    else:\n        return i + (n - 1 - j) - 1\n```",
