      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef punishmentNumber(n):\n    def can(s, target):\n        if not s:\n            return target == 0\n        if target < 0:\n            return False\n        for i in range(1, len(s) + 1):\n            if can(s[i:], target - int(s[:i])):\n                return True\n        return False\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if can(str(i * i), i):\n            total += i * i\n    return total\n```",
