    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    diff = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix = len(set(nums[:i+1]))\n        suffix = len(set(nums[i+1:]))\n        diff.append(prefix - suffix)\n    return diff\n```",
