      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    people = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        C = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n        A = [int(input_data[idx+j]) for j in range(C)]\n        idx += C\n        people.append((C, A))\n    X = int(input_data[idx])\n    \n    candidates = [(i+1, C) for i, (C, A) in enumerate(people) if X in A]\n    if not candidates:\n        print(0)\n        print()\n        return\n    min_c = min(c for _, c in candidates)\n    result = [i for i, c in candidates if c == min_c]\n    print(len(result))\n    print(*result)\n\nmain()\n```",
