      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumCost(source, target, original, changed, cost):\n    INF = float('inf')\n    dist = [[INF]*26 for _ in range(26)]\n    for i in range(26):\n        dist[i][i] = 0\n    for o, c, z in zip(original, changed, cost):\n        a, b = ord(o)-ord('a'), ord(c)-ord('a')\n        if z < dist[a][b]:\n            dist[a][b] = z\n    for k in range(26):\n        for i in range(26):\n            if dist[i][k] == INF: continue\n            for j in range(26):\n                nd = dist[i][k] + dist[k][j]\n                if nd < dist[i][j]:\n                    dist[i][j] = nd\n    total = 0\n    for s, t in zip(source, target):\n        a, b = ord(s)-ord('a'), ord(t)-ord('a')\n        if dist[a][b] == INF:\n            return -1\n        total += dist[a][b]\n    return total\n```",
