    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countCompleteSubstrings(word, k):\n    n = len(word)\n    # Split into segments where adjacent diff <= 2\n    segments = []\n    start = 0\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if abs(ord(word[i]) - ord(word[i-1])) > 2:\n            segments.append(word[start:i])\n            start = i\n    segments.append(word[start:])\n    \n    result = 0\n    for seg in segments:\n        L = len(seg)\n        # Try each number of distinct chars from 1 to 26\n        for num_distinct in range(1, 27):\n            window_size = num_distinct * k\n            if window_size > L:\n                break\n            count = [0] * 26\n            for i in range(window_size):\n                count[ord(seg[i]) - ord('a')] += 1\n            \n            def check():\n                for c in count:\n                    if c != 0 and c != k:\n                        return False\n                return True\n            \n            if check():\n                result += 1\n            \n            for i in range(window_size, L):\n                count[ord(seg[i]) - ord('a')] += 1\n                count[ord(seg[i - window_size]) - ord('a')] -= 1\n                if check():\n                    result += 1\n    \n    return result\n```",
