    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "<think>\nDFS from book 1, collect post-order, exclude 1.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom sys import setrecursionlimit\n\ndef main():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n    prereq = [[] for _ in range(N+1)]\n    for i in range(1, N+1):\n        c = int(input_data[idx]); idx += 1\n        for _ in range(c):\n            prereq[i].append(int(input_data[idx])); idx += 1\n    \n    # Iterative DFS from 1, collect only reachable, post-order\n    visited = [False] * (N+1)\n    order = []\n    stack = [(1, 0)]\n    visited[1] = True\n    while stack:\n        node, i = stack[-1]\n        if i < len(prereq[node]):\n            stack[-1] = (node, i+1)\n            nxt = prereq[node][i]\n            if not visited[nxt]:\n                visited[nxt] = True\n                stack.append((nxt, 0))\n        else:\n            stack.pop()\n            order.append(node)\n    \n    order.pop()  # remove book 1\n    print(*order)\n\nmain()\n```",
