      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumBeautifulSubstrings(s):\n    powers = set()\n    p = 1\n    while p < (1 << 16):\n        powers.add(bin(p)[2:])\n        p *= 5\n    \n    n = len(s)\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if s[j] == '0':\n                continue\n            if s[j:i] in powers and dp[j] != float('inf'):\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)\n    return dp[n] if dp[n] != float('inf') else -1\n```",
