      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumOperationsToMakeEqual(x, y):\n    from collections import deque\n    if x <= y:\n        return y - x\n    visited = {x}\n    q = deque([(x, 0)])\n    while q:\n        cur, steps = q.popleft()\n        if cur == y:\n            return steps\n        nexts = [cur - 1, cur + 1]\n        if cur % 5 == 0:\n            nexts.append(cur // 5)\n        if cur % 11 == 0:\n            nexts.append(cur // 11)\n        for n in nexts:\n            if n < 1 or n in visited:\n                continue\n            if n <= y:\n                return steps + 1 + (y - n)\n            visited.add(n)\n            q.append((n, steps + 1))\n```",
