      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef beautifulIndices(s, a, b, k):\n    def find_all(pat):\n        res = []\n        start = 0\n        while True:\n            idx = s.find(pat, start)\n            if idx == -1:\n                break\n            res.append(idx)\n            start = idx + 1\n        return res\n    \n    a_indices = find_all(a)\n    b_indices = find_all(b)\n    \n    result = []\n    from bisect import bisect_left\n    for i in a_indices:\n        pos = bisect_left(b_indices, i - k)\n        if pos < len(b_indices) and b_indices[pos] <= i + k:\n            result.append(i)\n    return result\n```",
