      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countMatchingSubarrays(nums, pattern):\n    n = len(nums)\n    m = len(pattern)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n - m):\n        match = True\n        for k in range(m):\n            a, b = nums[i + k], nums[i + k + 1]\n            if pattern[k] == 1 and not b > a:\n                match = False\n                break\n            if pattern[k] == 0 and not b == a:\n                match = False\n                break\n            if pattern[k] == -1 and not b < a:\n                match = False\n                break\n        if match:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```",
