      "generated_answer": "<think>\nSimple: group indices by color, rotate right by 1.\n</think>\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    N, M = int(input_data[0]), int(input_data[1])\n    S = list(input_data[2])\n    C = list(map(int, input_data[3:3+N]))\n    \n    groups = [[] for _ in range(M+1)]\n    for i, c in enumerate(C):\n        groups[c].append(i)\n    \n    for i in range(1, M+1):\n        pos = groups[i]\n        chars = [S[p] for p in pos]\n        # right shift by 1\n        chars = [chars[-1]] + chars[:-1]\n        for p, ch in zip(pos, chars):\n            S[p] = ch\n    \n    print(''.join(S))\n\nmain()\n```",
