      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minOperations(nums, target):\n    if sum(nums) < target:\n        return -1\n    count = [0] * 32\n    for n in nums:\n        count[n.bit_length() - 1] += 1\n    ops = 0\n    for i in range(31):\n        if (target >> i) & 1:\n            if count[i] > 0:\n                count[i] -= 1\n            else:\n                j = i + 1\n                while j < 32 and count[j] == 0:\n                    j += 1\n                if j == 32:\n                    return -1\n                while j > i:\n                    count[j] -= 1\n                    count[j-1] += 2\n                    j -= 1\n                    ops += 1\n                count[i] -= 1\n        count[i+1] += count[i] // 2\n    return ops\n```",
