      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef getSmallestString(s, k):\n    result = []\n    for c in s:\n        for candidate in range(26):\n            # distance from c to candidate\n            d = ord(c) - ord('a')\n            dist = min(abs(d - candidate), 26 - abs(d - candidate))\n            if dist <= k:\n                result.append(chr(ord('a') + candidate))\n                k -= dist\n                break\n    return ''.join(result)\n```",
