      "generated_answer": "<think>\nSort by S desc, try top 2 different flavor, and same flavor best pair per flavor.\n</think>\n\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    cups = []\n    idx = 1\n    for i in range(n):\n        f = int(data[idx]); s = int(data[idx+1])\n        idx += 2\n        cups.append((f, s))\n    \n    cups.sort(key=lambda x: -x[1])\n    \n    ans = 0\n    # different flavor: find top two with different flavors\n    first = cups[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if cups[i][0] != first[0]:\n            ans = max(ans, first[1] + cups[i][1])\n            break\n    \n    # same flavor: top two per flavor\n    flavor_top = defaultdict(list)\n    for f, s in cups:\n        if len(flavor_top[f]) < 2:\n            flavor_top[f].append(s)\n    \n    for f, lst in flavor_top.items():\n        if len(lst) >= 2:\n            ans = max(ans, lst[0] + lst[1] // 2)\n    \n    print(ans)\n\nmain()\n```",
