      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef lexicographicallySmallestArray(nums, limit):\n    n = len(nums)\n    indexed = sorted(range(n), key=lambda i: nums[i])\n    result = [0] * n\n    i = 0\n    while i < n:\n        j = i + 1\n        while j < n and nums[indexed[j]] - nums[indexed[j-1]] <= limit:\n            j += 1\n        group_idx = sorted(indexed[i:j])\n        group_vals = [nums[indexed[k]] for k in range(i, j)]\n        for k, idx in enumerate(group_idx):\n            result[idx] = group_vals[k]\n        i = j\n    return result\n```",
