      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport heapq\n\ndef unmarkedSumArray(nums, queries):\n    n = len(nums)\n    marked = [False] * n\n    heap = [(nums[i], i) for i in range(n)]\n    heapq.heapify(heap)\n    total = sum(nums)\n    ans = []\n    for idx, k in queries:\n        if not marked[idx]:\n            marked[idx] = True\n            total -= nums[idx]\n        while k > 0 and heap:\n            v, i = heapq.heappop(heap)\n            if marked[i]:\n                continue\n            marked[i] = True\n            total -= v\n            k -= 1\n        ans.append(total)\n    return ans\n```",
