      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumSeconds(nums):\n    from collections import defaultdict\n    n = len(nums)\n    pos = defaultdict(list)\n    for i, v in enumerate(nums):\n        pos[v].append(i)\n    ans = n\n    for v, idxs in pos.items():\n        max_gap = idxs[0] + n - idxs[-1]\n        for i in range(1, len(idxs)):\n            max_gap = max(max_gap, idxs[i] - idxs[i-1])\n        ans = min(ans, max_gap // 2)\n    return ans\n```",
