      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumOperations(num):\n    n = len(num)\n    best = n  # delete all -> 0\n    \n    def find(a, b):\n        # find rightmost b, then rightmost a before it\n        j = num.rfind(b)\n        if j == -1:\n            return n\n        i = num.rfind(a, 0, j)\n        if i == -1:\n            return n\n        return n - i - 2\n    \n    for a, b in [('0','0'), ('2','5'), ('5','0'), ('7','5')]:\n        best = min(best, find(a, b))\n    \n    return best\n```",
