      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countInterestingSubarrays(nums, modulo, k):\n    from collections import defaultdict\n    count = defaultdict(int)\n    count[0] = 1\n    prefix = 0\n    result = 0\n    for num in nums:\n        if num % modulo == k:\n            prefix += 1\n        target = (prefix - k) % modulo\n        result += count[target]\n        count[prefix % modulo] += 1\n    return result\n```",
