      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumJumps(nums, target):\n    n = len(nums)\n    dp = [-1] * n\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for j in range(1, n):\n        for i in range(j):\n            if dp[i] != -1 and -target <= nums[j] - nums[i] <= target:\n                dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[i] + 1)\n    return dp[n-1]\n```",
