      "generated_answer": "The fraction of slots wasted due to multiple simultaneous transmission attempts is the probability that two or more stations transmit, which is \\(1 - P(0) - P(1)\\). With \\(p=0.35\\) and \\(n=5\\), \\(P(0) = 0.65^5 \\approx 0.1160\\) and \\(P(1) = 5 \\times 0.35 \\times 0.65^4 \\approx 0.3124\\), giving \\(1 - 0.1160 - 0.3124 = 0.5716 \\approx 0.572\\).\n\n\\boxed{C}",
