      "generated_answer": "The person repeatedly ignored both women's clearly expressed disinterest, invaded their privacy by searching for Maddie's profile, and forced them into unwanted contact. Respecting others' autonomy and boundaries is fundamental, and their persistence crossed into harassment despite multiple refusals.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
