at it deems harmful to the nation as a whole.\nI. valid, because the state has the right to tax resources found within its borders.\nJ. invalid, because the state cannot tax a resource that is vital to the national economy.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
