    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: An injunctive message can block a negative outcome of this process through the \"boomerang effect.\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
