      "generated_answer": "Let distance = d, speed = v, time = t = d/v.\n\nFaster: d/(v+1/2) = t-1 → d = (v+1/2)(t-1)\nSlower: d/(v-1) = t+3 → d = (v-1)(t+3)\n\nFrom first: vt = (v+1/2)(t-1) → 0 = -v + t/2 - 1/2 → t = 2v+1\nFrom second: vt = (v-1)(t+3) → 0 = 3v - t - 3 → t = 3v-3\n\nSo 2v+1 = 3v-3 → v = 4, t = 9, d = 36.\n\n\\boxed{36 \\text{ km, } 4 \\text{ km/hr}}",
